    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "The east end of the road. Sixty-three kilometres of track from the junction, better than two thirds of it laid across ground no survey has been over, and at the end of it the only settlement out here. It feeds itself off the bank and the bed \u2014 barley on the levee, water dug out of the gravel rather than lifted off it \u2014 and sells stone to the trains that came the long way for it."
  },
